the answers or what they need to learn.

00:16:49.752 --> 00:16:53.829
Sometimes they know already,
because they were exposed by that.

00:16:53.829 --> 00:16:59.698
But if they don't know, as Laura was
saying, they can quickly tap their network

00:16:59.698 --> 00:17:04.806
or expand their horizons there and
learn quickly about those things.

00:17:04.806 --> 00:17:10.934
And I would add to that, in our time,
we are particularly restricted

00:17:10.934 --> 00:17:17.496
from people that actually had experienced
doing what we are trying to do.

00:17:17.496 --> 00:17:20.644
In our case,
it was very hard in the beginning,

00:17:20.644 --> 00:17:24.044
if you're the first cohort
of startups in Brazil.

00:17:24.044 --> 00:17:27.888
And today, I see a big difference
of companies that are starting, and

00:17:27.888 --> 00:17:32.451
can actually recruit people that spent a
few years, working in other companies and

00:17:32.451 --> 00:17:37.175
