00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:02.902
When you think about going
back to Latin America and

00:22:02.902 --> 00:22:06.393
taking from where David just left it,

00:22:06.393 --> 00:22:11.533
what was the hardest part of
going back after Stanford?

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:22.920
&gt;&gt; [CROSSTALK]
&gt;&gt; Go Gab, right.

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:29.260
&gt;&gt; So I agree very much
with what David just said.

