Record amounts of money being raised
there has never been a better time

00:30:57.096 --> 00:31:03.130
to be an entrepreneur in Latin America and
to start something is this hype?

00:31:03.130 --> 00:31:04.840
Is this real?

00:31:04.840 --> 00:31:08.831
Is this like anything that
it will go through different

00:31:08.831 --> 00:31:11.964
cycles where what is your mindset to this?

00:31:11.964 --> 00:31:15.913
Because there's a lot of questions
on the chat coming in from a lot of

00:31:15.913 --> 00:31:20.002
people actually trying to understand
how important is to fundraise or

00:31:20.002 --> 00:31:22.760
if fundraising to measure success?

00:31:22.760 --> 00:31:27.713
How to think about starting
a company today in Latin America

00:31:27.713 --> 00:31:32.171
with all these founder
abilities to have money versus

00:31:32.171 --> 00:31:35.950
stay in some other place so
just a little bit.

00:31:35.950 --> 00:31:40.674
Love to get your thoughts on those topics.

00:31:40.674 --> 00:31:43.984
&gt;&gt; Nikki you should answer that one.

00:31:43.984 --> 00:31:47.525
You're investing in the region
&gt;&gt; Fair.

00:31:47.525 --> 00:31:51.907
&gt;&gt; So, I too was an entrepreneur in
the region as most of you know, and

00:31:51.907 --> 00:31:56.310
I am shocked with the amount of
capital that is available to start.

00:31:56.310 --> 00:32:00.954
I wish that had been the case 20 years
ago or even 10 years ago or even.

00:32:00.954 --> 00:32:05.736
I had a chance to meet David when he
was raising a seed round and I passed.

00:32:05.736 --> 00:32:10.470
He was a Colombian going to Brazil, but
we corrected the mistake later in life and

00:32:10.470 --> 00:32:11.662
we invested later.

00:32:11.662 --> 00:32:15.770
But I will say what is
different is it's just

00:32:15.770 --> 00:32:19.665
the quality of the mission of the people.

00:32:19.665 --> 00:32:24.586
I find that for the first time ever,
I'm seeing people who truly want to change

00:32:24.586 --> 00:32:29.447
the region and have the tools and the
technologies there these days to do it.

00:32:29.447 --> 00:32:33.793
So I find that to be different
than anytime before,

00:32:33.793 --> 00:32:36.226
in terms of what can be done.

00:32:36.226 --> 00:32:42.769
But I do think that the record amount
of money is not a recipe for success.

00:32:42.769 --> 00:32:47.607
If anything,
I'm more concerned that it will create

00:32:47.607 --> 00:32:52.989
the wrong incentives and
greed will overtake the mission.

00:32:52.989 --> 00:32:54.620
That's what I worry the most right now.

00:32:57.114 --> 00:33:00.173
&gt;&gt; I would just add to that in your ECC.

00:33:00.173 --> 00:33:04.288
You see, you probably have the best
perspective from all of us given your

00:33:04.288 --> 00:33:05.579
investing activity.

00:33:05.579 --> 00:33:10.354
But whenever you actually see the big
numbers, even if the money has increased

00:33:10.354 --> 00:33:15.055
a lot in South America, it's still very
much below what you would see in other

00:33:15.055 --> 00:33:18.844
