or to India, or to US.

00:33:18.844 --> 00:33:22.479
So availability of capital is
really everywhere and yes,

00:33:22.479 --> 00:33:27.228
it's great that it has improved in
Latin America but it's still relatively

00:33:27.228 --> 00:33:31.774
small compared to the size of
the opportunity that exists in the region.

00:33:31.774 --> 00:33:36.524
And I think it's at a point right
now where people are still very much

00:33:36.524 --> 00:33:40.282
