&gt;&gt; I was not in that top 10%,

00:51:45.261 --> 00:51:46.581
I can tell you that.

00:51:46.581 --> 00:51:48.940
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; Neither was I.

00:51:48.940 --> 00:51:49.792
[LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; So

00:51:49.792 --> 00:51:53.065
I'll finish it up by saying to all of you,
thank you.

00:51:53.065 --> 00:51:54.114
I know you're super busy.

00:51:54.114 --> 00:51:57.370
I appreciate you taking
an hour of your day for this.

00:51:57.370 --> 00:51:58.647
Appreciate all of you.

00:51:58.647 --> 00:52:01.437
Thank you, Lisa from Stanford for
putting this together.

00:52:01.437 --> 00:52:06.032
And we look forward to seeing a lot of
admissions, a lot of applications, and

00:52:06.032 --> 00:52:10.700
